//! Ports src/mln/style/layers and include/mln/style/layers.
//!
//! `<type>_layer.rs` and `<type>_layer_properties.rs` are generated by
//! //tools/style-codegen (the port of scripts/generate-style-code.mjs and
//! its .ejs templates) from scripts/style-spec-reference/v8.json, as C++
//! generates `<type>_layer.{hpp,cpp}` and `<type>_layer_properties.{hpp,cpp}`;
//! `//tools/style-codegen:generated_code_test` checks them. The
//! `<type>_layer_impl.rs` files are ported by hand, as their C++ files are
//! written by hand.

